From 1271cb01a95032c66a5f68bda94e7d5ea9248372 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 20 Jan 2022 11:36:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-69581] efuse: use device struct for dev specific data

Future devices we have multi-die architecture, common code should
be able to handle those configurations. Including device specific
headers from common code is not allowed anymore, and instead the
device structures should be used.

This patch paves the way for this architectural change, and moving
the efuse common code to this method of work.

Change-Id: I285f5c074f387ef8ba307aa54bf35e2f03469170
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/app/ppboot/ppboot.c b/app/ppboot/ppboot.c
